{"dialogue": [{"sender": "Ben", "body": "Hi! Following up on the dinner we arranged in DM to pass along the address.

It's Juniper Cafe, 48 Maple Ave. Are we still good for 7pm next Thursday, Oct 22?"}, {"sender": "Me", "body": "Hi Ben! Yes, that's the same one from our DMs.

Confirming Thursday, Oct 22 at 7pm at Juniper Cafe. Thanks for sending the address — see you there!"}, {"sender": "Ben", "body": "Perfect, confirmed — 7pm Thursday at Juniper Cafe. See you then!"}], "writer_note": "Ben follows up from DM with address, both confirm same Oct 22 dinner."}

